Hi!

I’m excited to announce a new update for the game! The underground world has become even more alive and unpredictable: the placement of resources and underground dangers is now procedurally generated every time you play. This means that each descent beneath the surface will bring a unique experience - with new materials, threats, and unexpected discoveries.

I’m actively working on further improvements to the game. In upcoming updates, you can expect:
 • Story elements and adventure events to make the world deeper and more engaging;
 • Expanded adventure mechanics and interaction with the environment;
 • A more complex and richly generated world, both underground and above;
 • And much more!

Stay tuned - I’ll be sharing progress and posting new updates as they’re ready.

See you soon!

